{"seq":3,"slug":"layer-skipping","title":"跳层机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/mechanism/layer-skipping","wordCount":1209,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"跳层机制\">跳层机制</h1><p>「深度混合」这个名字的落点在这一篇。路由器选出了 top-k（见 <a href=\"token-routing\">token 路由</a>），容量锁定了选几个（见 <a href=\"capacity-budget\">容量预算</a>），现在要回答最后一个机制问题：被选中和没被选中的 token 分别走哪条路，以及 MoD 块在整张网络里怎么摆，才让同一个模型对不同 token 呈现出不同的「深度」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条路径汇于残差流\">核心概念：两条路径汇于残差流</h2><p>每个 MoD 块把流过它的 token 一分为二：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>被选中的 token</strong>：进入块，做完整的自注意力加前馈，输出乘以门控权重后加回残差流。</li>\n<li><strong>未被选中的 token</strong>：什么都不做，原表示沿残差连接直接平移到下一块。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用一个统一的公式写出来（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{S}_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.075em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 块被选中的 token 集合）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Block</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_t^{l+1} = \\begin{cases} x_t^l + g(r_t^l)\\cdot \\text{Block}_l(x_t^l), &amp; t\\in\\mathcal{S}_l \\\\[4pt] x_t^l, &amp; t\\notin\\mathcal{S}_l \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.28em;vertical-align:-1.39em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.89em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Block</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.39em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.89em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.075em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.075em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.39em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>被跳过的 token 不是「丢失」了，而是带着它在上一块的表示原封不动地继续往上走，等待后面某个块可能把它选中。正因为残差连接的存在，跳层是安全的——它只是少了一次加工，而不是断了信息流。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;token x_t 进入第 l 块&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;t 在选中集 S_l?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;自注意力 + 前馈&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;乘门控 g(r_t)&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;加回残差: x + g·Block(x)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;残差直通: x 原样平移&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;进入第 l+1 块&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;不同 token 累计被选次数不同&lt;br/&gt;= 不同的有效深度&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"token x_t 进入第 l 块\"] --&gt; B{\"t 在选中集 S_l?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"自注意力 + 前馈\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"乘门控 g(r_t)\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"加回残差: x + g·Block(x)\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"残差直通: x 原样平移\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"进入第 l+1 块\"]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[\"不同 token 累计被选次数不同&lt;br/&gt;= 不同的有效深度\"]</pre><h2 id=\"有效深度-同一网络里的不同路径\">有效深度：同一网络里的不同路径</h2><p>把整张网络看完，每个 token 实际经过的「真正做了计算的块数」各不相同。定义 token 的有效深度为它在所有 MoD 块里被选中的次数（加上始终全量计算的普通层）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效深度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>dense</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>MoD 块</mtext></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效深度}(x_t) = L_\\text{dense} + \\sum_{l\\in\\text{MoD 块}} \\mathbb{1}[t\\in\\mathcal{S}_l]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效深度</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dense</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MoD </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">块</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.075em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>难 token 在多数 MoD 块都被选中，有效深度接近满深；易 token 在多数块都被跳过，有效深度浅。于是同一套参数、同一次前向里，混合了从浅到深的多条计算路径——这就是「深度混合」。它和早退出（单调前缀式退出）的区别在 <a href=\"../foundations/dynamic-compute\">动态计算分配</a> 里讲过：MoD 的跳过是逐块独立的，一个 token 完全可以「这块跳、下块进、再下块又跳」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"块的摆放-为什么每隔一层\">块的摆放：为什么每隔一层</h2><p>一个自然的问题是：要不要把每一层都做成 MoD 块？论文给出的经验答案是<strong>每隔一层放一个 MoD 块</strong>（交替排布：MoD 块、普通稠密块、MoD 块、普通稠密块……）。理由有两点：</p>\n<p>其一，保留一半的稠密层，保证每个 token 在网络里至少有稳定的「全量加工」机会，不至于某个重要 token 连续被多个 MoD 块跳过而严重欠加工。其二，交替排布在「省 FLOP」和「保质量」之间取得了实测最佳点；如果每一层都是 MoD（且容量很低），信息在残差流里可能被反复平移而缺乏足够的混合，质量下降。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>排布策略</th>\n<th>MoD 块占比</th>\n<th>FLOP 节省</th>\n<th>质量风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全稠密</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无（即基线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每隔一层 MoD</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>中等，论文主设置</td>\n<td>低，实测匹配基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每一层 MoD</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>较高，易欠加工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅中后段 MoD</td>\n<td>视层数</td>\n<td>取决于位置</td>\n<td>取决于位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>普通稠密层（非 MoD 的那一半）依旧对所有 token 全量计算，它们是保底，与 MoD 块的省算形成互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跳过对注意力的连带影响\">跳过对注意力的连带影响</h2><p>跳层不只是省了前馈。被跳过的 token 在这个 MoD 块里既不作为 query 去读别人，也（在论文的实现里）不更新自己的 key/value 贡献，这让自注意力的有效序列长度在该块缩短，注意力部分省下的 FLOP 甚至比前馈更多（注意力是序列长度的二次项）。但这也带来一个推理期的工程后果：被跳过 token 的 KV 缓存如何维护，会变得微妙——这属于工程范畴，留给 <a href=\"../practice/mod-inference\">推理实现</a>，本篇只点明跳层的影响会一路传导到 KV 缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跳层把每个 token 分到两条路：选中的进块算完加回残差，未选中的沿残差原样平移，残差连接保证跳过是安全的、信息不断流。</li>\n<li>每个 token 的「有效深度」等于它被选中的次数，难 token 深、易 token 浅，同一网络混合多条深度路径——这正是「深度混合」。</li>\n<li>块通常每隔一层摆一个（交替排布），用一半稠密层保底、一半 MoD 块省算，是实测的质量/省算最佳点。</li>\n<li>跳层连带缩短了 MoD 块内注意力的有效序列长度，省下更多 FLOP，但也把复杂度传导到推理期的 KV 缓存维护。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"token-routing\">token 路由</a> —— 谁被选中。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"capacity-budget\">容量预算</a> —— 选中几个。</li>\n<li>本库：<a href=\"../practice/mod-inference\">推理实现</a> —— 跳过 token 的 KV 缓存处理。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/foundations/prefill-decode-cache\">KV 缓存优化：预填充与解码缓存</a> —— 缓存视角下的连带影响。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跳层机制","id":"跳层机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条路径汇于残差流","id":"核心概念-两条路径汇于残差流"},{"level":2,"text":"有效深度：同一网络里的不同路径","id":"有效深度-同一网络里的不同路径"},{"level":2,"text":"块的摆放：为什么每隔一层","id":"块的摆放-为什么每隔一层"},{"level":2,"text":"跳过对注意力的连带影响","id":"跳过对注意力的连带影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"容量预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/mechanism/capacity-budget"},"next":{"title":"可微路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/training/differentiable-routing"}}